sentences.text:
The applicant is ordered to be released on bail in connection with F.I.R. registered as C.R. No. 11821011251299/2025 registered with Dahod A Division Police Station, Dahod, on executing a bond of Rs.25,000/- (Rupees Twenty Five Thousand only) with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
[a] not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty;
Nareshbhai Bachubhai Bhuriya vs State Of Gujarat on 2 March, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/97726586/
2 [b] not act in a manner injurious to the interest of the prosecution;
[c] surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
NEUTRAL CITATION R/CR.MA/5137/2026 ORDER DATED: 02/03/2026 undefined [d] not to leave State of Gujarat without prior permission of the Sessions Court;
[e] furnish the present address of residence to the I.O. and also to the Court at the time of execution of the bond and shall not change the residence without prior intimation to the I.O.;
[f] mark presence once a fortnight till the charge- sheet is filed and thereafter once a month for a period of six months before the concerned police station.

